<title>CANADA: CANADA C$2.3 BLN BOND DUE 2008 YIELDS 6.079 PCT.</title>
<headline>CANADA C$2.3 BLN BOND DUE 2008 YIELDS 6.079 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$2.3 billion auction of 6.00 percent bonds due June 1, 2008 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     6.079	99.392  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     6.070	99.462  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    6.087	99.330   67.66667</p>
<p>The bonds will be dated and delivered on August 15. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$5,056.35 million, including C$60.85 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield. Total outstanding is C$2.3 billion. Proceeds will be used for general purposes.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100)) (c) Reuters Limited 1997</p>
